    },
    "summary": "An **objective** whose location point is not in a **terrain area** is marked by a flat round marker 40mm across, centred on that point: an objective marker. Models may move across objective markers and end a move on them.\n\nA model counts as in range of one while within 3\" of it horizontally and 5\" vertically; measure distances to and from its nearest part.",
